sequenceDiagram
  participant Ops
  participant Signal
  participant Driver
  participant Dispatcher
  participant Manager
  Ops->>Signal: shutdown now
  Driver->>Signal: shouldShutdown at the next loop
  Driver-->>Dispatcher: ShutdownException
  Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: notice, then handle returns
  Manager->>Driver: start worker.php again
  Note over Signal: a worker that starts later keeps running
